arly Access Hello, alchemists! We have been waiting a long time to write this post. Alembix, our free-to-play card game built on the periodic table, is almost ready to open its doors. Our demo is part of Steam Next Fest (19 to 26 October), and we are aiming to launch in Early Access shortly after the festival ends. We will confirm the exact date here as soon as it is locked. Follow the game and add it to your wishlist and Steam will let you know the moment it goes li","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T20:50:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934628","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2415710-1835236783563972","game_id":"steam-2415710","kind":"announcement","title":"The Balance Is In: 6,000 Games Later, Alembix Is Ready for You","summary":"Hello alchemists,We have some news we have been genuinely excited to share. Over the past stretch of development we have put Alembix through its most rigorous testing yet, and today we want to pull back the curtain and show you exactly what we found. We also have an announcement about the next step on this journey, and it is one you can be part of.Let us get into it.Why we ran 6,000 gamesBalancing a trading card game is hard. A single tweak to one tribe can quietly tip the scales across the whol","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T16:09:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783563972","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2415710":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:36Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:36Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2415710":"2026-10-26T09:53:36Z"},"